<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Lookout Mountain (Ochocos) by the marked summer trail</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:319-3: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.349967" lon="-120.349431"><ele>1653.8</ele><name>Independent Pass (Road 42 at Road 4205)</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:road-42-4205 (OSM node 3094976843); confidence: high; pdf_page: 322; book_elev_ft: 5400; quote: The marked ski trail starts at Independent Pass (5,400 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.339858" lon="-120.359223"><ele>1798.7</ele><name>Summer trailhead (Mother Lode Mine Trailhead)</name><desc>source: OSM node 2997595259 Mother Lode Mine Trailhead = start of USFS trail 808; DEM 5,901 ft; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 322; book_elev_ft: 5800; quote: climbs the low ridge immediately to the right of the mine road to the Independent Mine 0.7 mile above the pass ... Continue 0.3 mile to the summer trailhead at 5,800 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.324960" lon="-120.351830"><ele>1907.5</ele><name>Aspen grove (low point of trail 808)</name><desc>source: lowest vertex of USFS trail 808 after the plateau, DEM 6,258 ft; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 321; book_elev_ft: 6280; quote: Follow trail markers on posts gently downhill across the prairie 0.7 mile to a grove of large aspens (map 77: ASPEN GROVE 6280')</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.326885" lon="-120.373107"><ele>2112.4</ele><name>Lookout Mountain summit</name><desc>source: OSM node 5423575768 Lookout Mountain; DEM 6,930 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 322; book_elev_ft: 6926; quote: From the grove climb south then west 2 miles to the summit</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Lookout Mountain (Ochocos) by the marked summer trail</name><desc>1. Independent Pass (Road 42 at Road 4205) -&gt; Summer trailhead (Mother Lode Mine Trailhead): usfs-trail (high), 1.05 mi | 2. Summer trailhead (Mother Lode Mine Trailhead) -&gt; Aspen grove (low point of trail 808): usfs-trail (high), 2.33 mi | 3. Aspen grove (low point of trail 808) -&gt; Lookout Mountain summit: usfs-trail (high), 1.75 mi</desc>
